<title>LEBANON: Lebanese money market rates - Banks Assn.</title>
<headline>Lebanese money market rates - Banks Assn.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Lebanese Banks Association issued the following money market details on Monday: Market in Lebanese pounds:</p>
<p>				     Dec 95   Oct 96   Nov 96   Dec 96</p>
<p> Average rate on Deposits (%) 17.12   14.59    14.47    14.69</p>
<p> Estimated interest spread     3.33    3.07     2.89     2.79</p>
<p>NOTE: Estimated interest spread does not take into account</p>
<p>operating expenses and cost of capital.</p>
<p>Market in Foreign Exchange:</p>
<p> Average rate on Deposits (%)  5.46    5.56     5.59     5.62</p>
<p> Estimated interest spread     3.82    3.43     3.53     3.34</p>
<p>NOTE: Estimated interest spread does not take into account operating expenses and cost of capital.</p>
<p>-Beirut editorial (961 1) 602057</p>
</text>
